* 3D drop solver: token 2 (p15) = 0.5. Die 1 lifted 10, workpiece 2 lifted 3, dropped along -z. The initial drop moves it by -(3 + p15/2) = -3.25; all 16 bottom nodes then touch die 3 around the centre, the equilibrium test stops at once. Expect workpiece moved by about (0,0,-3.25) and 'Object 2 has been dropped successfully.'
KFREAD 0
UPSET_Brick.KEY
OBJPOS 1 1 0 0 10
OBJPOS 2 1 0 0 3
OBJPOS 2 7 0.5 0 0 -1 0 0 0 0
KFWRIT
OUT.KEY
